"""
K2 UDISK environment slot manager.

Swaps /mnt/UDISK contents between two named environment slots
('stock' and 'custom') with idempotent file moves and an atomic
U-Boot env write.

Usage:
    swap                # swap to the other environment
    swap status         # show running env and available slots
"""

